	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14_swleader8_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>シズイ『あの　くろい　ふね
プラズマだんの　もの　なんね▼
で　プラズマだん　って
なにしておる　れんちゅう　よ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T10:04:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T09:59:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>シズイ『あの　黒い　帆船
プラズマ団の　もん　なんね▼
で　プラズマ団　って
なにしておる　連中よ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T10:04:19" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T09:59:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・c08ジムバッジ取得後
・暫定ラベル、現状未使用</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T10:00:43" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ジムリーダー
シズイ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T09:59:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#0080c0</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14_swleader1_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>チェレン『エネルギーが　ないのか
プラズマだんの　ふねは　うごかないね▼
あえて　きみたちを
きけんに　まきこむ　わけ　だからね▼
できるかぎりの　じゅんびは　しておきたい
というわけで　ジムバッジを　よろしく！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T10:07:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T09:33:01" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>チェレン『エネルギーが　ないのか
プラズマ団の　船は　動かないね▼
あえて　きみたちを
危険に　まきこむ　わけ　だからね▼
できるかぎりの　準備は　しておきたい
というわけで　ジムバッジを　よろしく！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T10:07:33" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T09:33:01" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・暫定ラベル、現状未使用</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T10:02:46" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER1
ジムリーダー・チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T09:33:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14_middleman2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おっ　あんた
ジムリーダーに　ちょうせん？▼
だけど　シーちゃんに　あえっかな？
なんたって　にんきもの　だもんな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T09:02:01" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おっ　あんた
ジムリーダーに　挑戦？▼
だけど　シーちゃんに　会えっかな？
なんたって　人気者だもんな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T10:05:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・GRIDX＝795、GRIDZ＝171辺り</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T09:49:42" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MIDDLEMAN2</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T09:39:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14_swimmerw_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なみまに　ぷかぷか
うかぶ　あたしは　にんぎょ　なの▼
そういえば　カントーちほうに
おてんばにんぎょ　っていわれる▽
